// Golden operation vectors for the decimal128 engine, computed by
// Python's `decimal` under the IEEE 754-2019 decimal128 context
// (prec=34, Emax=6144, Emin=-6143, ROUND_HALF_EVEN) — the standard's
// own arithmetic, cross-checked against MoonFrame's Dec128. Each
// line is op|a|b|expected; the driver parses all four and asserts
// the operation's result equals the expected value (a NaN expected
// asserts a NaN result; value equality, so cohort spellings compare
// by value).

